# Example secrets file for wechat-box-stack-heal.
#
# Copy this file to a private location and fill in the real values:
#   install -m 600 -D .env.example "$HOME/secrets/phone-socks.env"
#   $EDITOR "$HOME/secrets/phone-socks.env"
#
# Never commit the filled file. install.sh reads it without executing it.
# Only the PHONE_SOCKS_* / SOCKS_* keys below are read from this file.

# --- Domestic SOCKS5 exit (phone or PC reached over Tailscale) ---
PHONE_SOCKS_HOST=<PHONE_TS_IP>
PHONE_SOCKS_PORT=1080
PHONE_SOCKS_USER=<SOCKS_USER>
PHONE_SOCKS_PASS=<SOCKS_PASS>

# Legacy aliases are also accepted if the PHONE_* names are absent:
# SOCKS_HOST=<PHONE_TS_IP>
# SOCKS_PORT=1080
# SOCKS_USER=<SOCKS_USER>
# SOCKS_PASS=<SOCKS_PASS>

# --- Optional stack settings ---
# These are shell environment variables for install.sh / the watchdog, not
# keys in this secrets file. Export them before running install.sh if needed:
#   BOX_TS_IP_PREFIX=100.   # prefix of the box tailnet address
#   TS_STATE_DIR=$HOME/tailscale
#   MIN_GAP=600             # watchdog restart cooldown, seconds
#   WX_DISPLAY=:2           # pinned X display
